{
  "format": "sqlib-notebook/1",
  "title": "Parameters",
  "library": "urn:sqlib:library:rail",
  "cells": [
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md1",
      "source": "# Parameters\n\nEvery form of parameter sqlib reads from query text, on the Rail network."
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md2",
      "source": "## Two variables in one parameter\n\n`VALUES (?from ?to) { (UNDEF UNDEF) }` takes pairs. A second `VALUES ?before { UNDEF }` is a second parameter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c1",
      "label": "Central to Museum, Northgate to Parkside, before 1950",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-direct-lines-between",
      "out": "pairs",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "from": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/central"
              },
              "to": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/museum"
              }
            },
            {
              "from": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/northgate"
              },
              "to": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/parkside"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "before": {
                "type": "literal",
                "value": "1950",
                "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md3",
      "source": "Leave the year out and every line counts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c2",
      "label": "Central to Museum, Northgate to Parkside, any year",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-direct-lines-between",
      "out": "pairsAny",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "from": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/central"
              },
              "to": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/museum"
              }
            },
            {
              "from": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/northgate"
              },
              "to": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/parkside"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md4",
      "source": "## Named LIMIT and OFFSET\n\n`LIMIT 0001` and `OFFSET 0002` are numbers called 1 and 2."
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c3",
      "label": "The second page of five stations",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-stations-page",
      "out": "page2",
      "slots": [],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store",
      "limits": {
        "1": 5
      },
      "offsets": {
        "2": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md5",
      "source": "## ASK\n\nA parameter works the same in an ASK query."
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c4",
      "label": "Is Museum step-free?",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-station-is-step-free",
      "out": "museum",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "station": {
                "type": "uri",
                "value": "https://example.org/rail/museum"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "id": "md6",
      "source": "## VALUES or FILTER\n\nThe same question two ways. The benchmark *VALUES or FILTER* times them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c5",
      "label": "Stations in zones 1 and 2 (VALUES)",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-stations-in-zones",
      "out": "zonesValues",
      "slots": [
        {
          "from": "typed",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "zone": {
                "type": "literal",
                "value": "1",
                "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
              }
            },
            {
              "zone": {
                "type": "literal",
                "value": "2",
                "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    },
    {
      "kind": "query",
      "id": "c6",
      "label": "Stations in zones 1 and 2 (FILTER)",
      "query": "urn:sqlib:query:rail-stations-in-zones-filter",
      "out": "zonesFilter",
      "slots": [],
      "backend": "urn:sqlib:backend:rail-store"
    }
  ]
}
